  "details": "As a user I would like to debug my avatars in more meaningful ways without leaving VR. \nThe current behavior once you open up the debug menu is that you see a large list of variables and states. If that list is too long it allows you to scroll. Currently, to scroll down you need to hit the Page Down button on your physical keyboard. The virtual keyboard input for this does not work.\nI'd like for Page Down and Page Up to be supported on the virtual keyboard when debugging an avatar in VR.",
